  "name": "Question 3",
  "problem": "What is $(-12)^{-1}?$",
  "worked_solution": "The expression $(-12)^{-1}$ means the reciprocal of $-12.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n(-12)^{-1}=-\\frac{1}{12}.\n$$",
